Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.84,0:26:09.28,Main,,0,0,0,,{\a6\i1}Baby 5...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.27,0:26:09.90,Captions,,0,370,480,,{\fs162\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\bord3}Baby 5
